{"title": "The Weeping Dawn", "pageid": 50168, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Weeping_Dawn", "categories": ["Music"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-game\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"title\">The Weeping Dawn</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cover\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">            <div style=\"margin: -10px -10px 0 -10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Alfira-dawn.png/300px-Alfira-dawn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Alfira-dawn.png/450px-Alfira-dawn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Alfira-dawn.png/600px-Alfira-dawn.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Alfira-dawn.png/300px-Alfira-dawn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"325\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Alfira-dawn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Details</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"genre\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Genre</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ballad</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"composer\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Composer</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm2828130\">Borislav Slavov</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocals\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocals</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm15267195\">Ilona Ivanova</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"length\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Length</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2:47</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"link\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Link</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VZXFi9mpIS4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"The Weeping Dawn\" src=\"/w/images/7/75/YouTube.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VZXFi9mpIS4\">The Weeping Dawn</a></span></div>\n</div></section></section></aside>\n\n<p><b>The Weeping Dawn</b><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> is a song composed by the tiefling bard <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/38px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/50px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alfira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> to honor her late mentor Lihala. Depending on the party's actions, Alfira may perform the song in full in a cutscene.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/38px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/50px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alfira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> is on the hill overlooking the druidic shrine circle at the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a>. She is frustrated over a lack of progress in composing a song for her recently deceased teacher, Lihala. \n</p><p>The party can choose to help by inspiring her. If a party member offers aid by encouraging Alfira with words, she becomes inspired and a cutscene plays where she performs her near-finished song for the party. She titles her song <i>\"The Weeping Dawn\"</i> and confesses in tears that she was with her teacher Lihala when they were ambushed by <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">gnolls</a>, and that since then she has been struggling to create a worthy eulogy for her. \n</p><p>For helping her party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer\" title=\"Entertainer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/20px-Background_Entertainer_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/30px-Background_Entertainer_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/40px-Background_Entertainer_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Entertainer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png/20px-Background_Entertainer_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Background_Entertainer_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer\" title=\"Entertainer\">Entertainer</a> background can gain the inspiration <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer#A_Bard's_Muse\" title=\"Entertainer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A Bard's Muse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Entertainer#A_Bard's_Muse\" title=\"Entertainer\">A Bard's Muse</a>. Alfira then remains in this location, giving finishing touches to her song and singing it periodically.\n</p><p>An instrumental version of this song plays occasionally while the party explore the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Lyrics\">Lyrics</span></h2>\n<div style=\"font-size:92%; line-height: 2.1em;\" class=\"poem\">\n<p>Dance upon the stars tonight.<br>\nSmile, and pain will fade away.<br>\nWords of mine will turn to ash<br>\nWhen you call the last light down.<br>\n<br>\nMoon reminds me of your grace,<br>\nAll the love I cannot repay.<br>\nRest and know that I will pray.<br>\nFarewell, my dear old friend.<br>\n<br>\nMoon, sun, all remind me of your grace.<br>\nFaith, care, all the love I can't repay.<br>\nMoon, sun, all remind me of your grace.<br>\nFaith, care, all the love I can't repay.<br>\n<br>\nDance upon the stars tonight.<br>\nSmile, and pain will fade away.<br>\nWords of mine will turn to ash<br>\nWhen you call the last light down.<br>\n<br>\nMoon reminds me of your grace,<br>\nAll the love I can't repay.<br>\nRest and know that I will pray.<br>\nFarewell, my dear old friend.<br>\n<br>\nDance upon the stars tonight.<br>\nSmile, and pain will fade away.\n</p>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> As titled by Alfira. Listed as <i>Weeping Dawn</i> in the game's <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3_-_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3 - Original Soundtrack\">soundtrack</a>. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195623\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1550/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9279/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1754/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6110/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 640350/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.666      1 -total\n 59.32%   31.239      1 Template:Infobox_misc\n 27.72%   14.599      5 Template:Icon_link\n 26.66%   14.043      5 Template:Icon_text\n 23.06%   12.147     20 Template:Trim\n 19.04%   10.025      1 Template:Youtube\n 18.44%    9.709      1 Template:Reflist\n 15.78%    8.309      5 Template:Ifempty\n  8.70%    4.582      2 Template:Credits\n  8.36%    4.404      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:50168-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195623 and revision id 397108. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>